		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.096)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "FOLD / ASSEMBLY ORIENTATION (fold line x = 136, island B folds UNDER island A):\n- Island A F side (all SMT parts) faces UP, away from the wrist.\n- Island B F side faces DOWN to the case floor: dock pads J601 face the dock.\n- Cell and LRA mount on island B's B side (inner face, between the islands):\n  cell tabs solder to TP201 (+) / TP202 (-), LRA leads to TP501 (+) / TP502 (-), all on B.Cu;\n  LRA tapes onto the FR4 stiffener in the 8 mm motor strip beside the cell.\n- All SMT parts are on F (single-sided assembly); B-side pads are hand-soldered after the fold."
		(at 96 132.5 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "54c463c7-1d5a-44ed-8605-4fd8f9875746")
		(effects
